          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Allow Accessibility…" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "允许辅助功能…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Allow Screen Recording…" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "允许屏幕录制…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Allow connections from the internet" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "允许来自互联网的连接"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Allow in System Settings…" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在系统设置中允许…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Allowed" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "已允许"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Allow…" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "允许…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "An iPhone or iPad Needs Sill Updated" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "有 iPhone 或 iPad 需要更新 Sill"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "An update of Sill didn’t finish: the new version didn’t start the first time, and Sill’s watcher couldn’t leave a whole copy of Sill in its place. If this copy misbehaves, download Sill again from getsill.app." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Sill 的一次更新未能完成：新版本首次未能启动，Sill 的监视进程也无法在原位置留下一份完整的 Sill。如果这份副本运行异常，请从 getsill.app 重新下载 Sill。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Another copy of Sill is running. Quit it first, then update." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "另一份 Sill 正在运行。请先退出它，然后再更新。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Another user is on this Mac’s screen. Devices see this account, and can’t click or type in it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "另一位用户正在使用这台 Mac 的屏幕。设备看到的是这个账户，但无法在其中点按或输入。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Another user is on this Mac’s screen. You’re seeing your account’s own desktop and windows, not the screen. Taps, keys and opening apps wait until your account is back on it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "另一位用户正在使用这台 Mac 的屏幕。你看到的是你账户自己的桌面和窗口，而不是屏幕。轻点、按键和打开 App 要等你的账户回到屏幕上后才会生效。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Another user started controlling this Mac." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "另一位用户开始控制这台 Mac。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Another user started controlling this Mac. Log in to your account to reactivate screen sharing with Sill." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "另一位用户开始控制这台 Mac。请登录你的账户以重新启用 Sill 屏幕共享。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Any device on your network (or nearby, with Direct Wireless Connection on) and any app on this Mac can see and control it without pairing. Connections are still encrypted." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你网络中的任何设备（或打开无线直连时附近的任何设备）以及这台 Mac 上的任何 App 都无需配对即可查看并控制它。连接仍然是加密的。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Anyone on the internet can now reach port %@ and try to connect. Sill turns away every device you haven’t paired. Turning this off doesn’t close the port on your router: remove the forward there too." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "现在互联网上的任何人都能访问端口 %@ 并尝试连接。Sill 会拒绝所有你未配对的设备。关闭此项不会关闭路由器上的端口：请同时在路由器上删除端口转发。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apple hasn’t notarized the downloaded app" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Apple 尚未公证下载的 App"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Approve Sill in System Settings › Login Items" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "请在“系统设置 › 登录项”中批准 Sill"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Approve in System Settings…" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在系统设置中批准…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Asking your router…" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "正在询问路由器…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Automatically update Sill" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
