    "Firewall" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "防火墙"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "For a Mac you reach only through Sill. While another user, or the login window, is on this Mac’s screen, devices see this account’s own desktop and windows instead of nothing: not what the screen shows, and nothing they tap or type reaches this account until it’s back on the screen." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "适用于只通过 Sill 访问的 Mac。另一位用户或登录窗口占用这台 Mac 的屏幕时，设备会看到这个账户自己的桌面和窗口，而不是一片空白：看到的不是屏幕上显示的内容，并且在这个账户回到屏幕上之前，设备上的轻点和输入都不会传到它。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Forward TCP port %@ on your router to this Mac (%@), and reserve that address for this Mac in the router’s settings." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在路由器上将 TCP 端口 %1$@ 转发到这台 Mac（%2$@），并在路由器设置中为这台 Mac 保留该地址。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Frame Rate" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "帧率"
          }
        }
