      }
    },
    "On · %@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "开 · %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On · no VPN on this Mac" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "开 · 这台 Mac 上没有 VPN"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Once a day, Sill asks GitHub whether a newer version is out. GitHub sees this Mac’s IP address and which version of Sill it has; nothing else is sent. Automatically update Sill is on: Sill downloads a new version %@, then installs it and restarts once no device has been connected for %lld minutes; it never disconnects anyone. Before it installs a new version, Sill checks it two ways: it must carry Apple’s signature and notarization for Sill’s developer, and the release must be signed with Sill’s own update key. Update Now checks it the same way, at once." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Once a day, Sill asks GitHub whether a newer version is out. GitHub sees this Mac’s IP address and which version of Sill it has; nothing else is sent. Automatically update Sill is on: Sill downloads a new version %1$@, then installs it and restarts once no device has been connected for %2$lld minutes; it never disconnects anyone. Before it installs a new version, Sill checks it two ways: it must carry Apple’s signature and notarization for Sill’s developer, and the release must be signed with Sill’s own update key. Update Now checks it the same way, at once."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Sill 每天询问一次 GitHub 是否有新版本。GitHub 会看到这台 Mac 的 IP 地址和 Sill 的版本号，不会发送其他任何信息。“自动更新 Sill”已开启：%1$@，Sill 会下载新版本，然后在连续 %2$lld 分钟没有设备连接时安装并重新启动；它从不断开任何人的连接。安装新版本前，Sill 会从两方面检查它：它必须带有 Apple 为 Sill 开发者提供的签名和公证，并且该正式版必须用 Sill 自己的更新密钥签名。“立即更新”会以同样的方式检查，只是立即进行。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Once a day, Sill asks GitHub whether a newer version is out. GitHub sees this Mac’s IP address and which version of Sill it has; nothing else is sent. Sill downloads and installs nothing by itself. Update Now downloads the new version from GitHub, puts it in place of this copy and restarts Sill; Open Release Page… shows it on GitHub instead. Before it installs a new version, Sill checks it two ways: it must carry Apple’s signature and notarization for Sill’s developer, and the release must be signed with Sill’s own update key." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Sill 每天询问一次 GitHub 是否有新版本。GitHub 会看到这台 Mac 的 IP 地址和 Sill 的版本号，不会发送其他任何信息。Sill 不会自行下载或安装任何东西。“立即更新”会从 GitHub 下载新版本，替换当前这份副本并重新启动 Sill；“打开发布页面…”则在 GitHub 上显示新版本。安装新版本前，Sill 会从两方面检查它：它必须带有 Apple 为 Sill 开发者提供的签名和公证，并且该正式版必须用 Sill 自己的更新密钥签名。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Once a day, Sill asks GitHub whether a newer version is out. GitHub sees this Mac’s IP address and which version of Sill it has; nothing else is sent. Sill never downloads or installs anything by itself: a new version opens its page on GitHub, where you download it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Sill 每天询问一次 GitHub 是否有新版本。GitHub 会看到这台 Mac 的 IP 地址和 Sill 的版本号，不会发送其他任何信息。Sill 从不自行下载或安装任何东西：有新版本时会打开它在 GitHub 上的页面，由你自己下载。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Once a day, and with nightly builds on each time Sill opens, Sill asks GitHub whether a newer version is out. GitHub sees this Mac’s IP address and which version of Sill it has; nothing else is sent. Automatically update Sill is on: Sill downloads a new release %@, then installs it and restarts once no device has been connected for %lld minutes; it never disconnects anyone. A nightly build installs only when you click Update Now. Before it installs a new version, Sill checks it two ways: it must carry Apple’s signature and notarization for Sill’s developer, and a release must be signed with Sill’s own update key; a nightly build is signed by GitHub, which builds it. Update Now checks it the same way, at once." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Once a day, and with nightly builds on each time Sill opens, Sill asks GitHub whether a newer version is out. GitHub sees this Mac’s IP address and which version of Sill it has; nothing else is sent. Automatically update Sill is on: Sill downloads a new release %1$@, then installs it and restarts once no device has been connected for %2$lld minutes; it never disconnects anyone. A nightly build installs only when you click Update Now. Before it installs a new version, Sill checks it two ways: it must carry Apple’s signature and notarization for Sill’s developer, and a release must be signed with Sill’s own update key; a nightly build is signed by GitHub, which builds it. Update Now checks it the same way, at once."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Sill 每天询问一次 GitHub 是否有新版本；开启每夜版后，每次打开 Sill 时也会询问。GitHub 会看到这台 Mac 的 IP 地址和 Sill 的版本号，不会发送其他任何信息。“自动更新 Sill”已开启：%1$@，Sill 会下载新的正式版，然后在连续 %2$lld 分钟没有设备连接时安装并重新启动；它从不断开任何人的连接。每夜版只有在你点按“立即更新”时才会安装。安装新版本前，Sill 会从两方面检查它：它必须带有 Apple 为 Sill 开发者提供的签名和公证，并且正式版必须用 Sill 自己的更新密钥签名；每夜版则由构建它的 GitHub 签名。“立即更新”会以同样的方式检查，只是立即进行。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Once a day, and with nightly builds on each time Sill opens, Sill asks GitHub whether a newer version is out. GitHub sees this Mac’s IP address and which version of Sill it has; nothing else is sent. Sill downloads and installs nothing by itself. Update Now downloads the new version from GitHub, puts it in place of this copy and restarts Sill; Open Release Page… shows it on GitHub instead. Before it installs a new version, Sill checks it two ways: it must carry Apple’s signature and notarization for Sill’s developer, and a release must be signed with Sill’s own update key; a nightly build is signed by GitHub, which builds it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Sill 每天询问一次 GitHub 是否有新版本；开启每夜版后，每次打开 Sill 时也会询问。GitHub 会看到这台 Mac 的 IP 地址和 Sill 的版本号，不会发送其他任何信息。Sill 不会自行下载或安装任何东西。“立即更新”会从 GitHub 下载新版本，替换当前这份副本并重新启动 Sill；“打开发布页面…”则在 GitHub 上显示新版本。安装新版本前，Sill 会从两方面检查它：它必须带有 Apple 为 Sill 开发者提供的签名和公证，并且正式版必须用 Sill 自己的更新密钥签名；每夜版则由构建它的 GitHub 签名。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Only needed for a port forward on your router. A VPN is simpler and keeps this Mac off the open internet." : {
