            "value" : "正在串流到 %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Streaming with the software encoder, up to 60 fps, until it is free again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "正在使用软件编码器串流（最高 60 fps），直到硬件编码器空闲。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Streaming with the software encoder, up to 60 fps. Restarting the Mac fixes this." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "正在使用软件编码器串流（最高 60 fps）。重新启动 Mac 即可解决。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Test Pattern" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "测试图案"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Test Pattern Mode" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "测试图案模式"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Text you copy here can be pasted on a connected iPhone or iPad, and text sent from one with Paste becomes this Mac’s." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在这里拷贝的文本可以粘贴到已连接的 iPhone 或 iPad 上；从设备通过“粘贴”发送的文本也会进入这台 Mac 的剪贴板。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Text you copy on %@ is ready to paste on this %@. To paste on %@, copy text here and tap Paste: it goes where %@’s cursor is. With Paste on %@ Right Away off, Paste only puts it on %@’s clipboard." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Text you copy on %1$@ is ready to paste on this %2$@. To paste on %3$@, copy text here and tap Paste: it goes where %4$@’s cursor is. With Paste on %5$@ Right Away off, Paste only puts it on %6$@’s clipboard."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你在 %1$@ 上拷贝的文本可以直接粘贴到这台 %2$@ 上。要粘贴到 %3$@，在这里拷贝文本并轻点“粘贴”：文本会出现在 %4$@ 的光标处。如果关闭“立即在 %5$@ 上粘贴”，“粘贴”只会把文本放到 %6$@ 的剪贴板。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Text you copy on %@ is ready to paste on this %@. To paste on %@, copy text here, tap Paste, then press ⌘V there." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Text you copy on %1$@ is ready to paste on this %2$@. To paste on %3$@, copy text here, tap Paste, then press ⌘V there."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你在 %1$@ 上拷贝的文本可以直接粘贴到这台 %2$@ 上。要粘贴到 %3$@，在这里拷贝文本，轻点“粘贴”，然后在那里按 ⌘V。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That doesn’t look like an address. Try home.example.net, or home.example.net:17455." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这看起来不像地址。请尝试 home.example.net 或 home.example.net:17455。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Mac" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这台 Mac"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Mac keeps playing it too" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Mac 也会继续播放"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The devices you pair in Devices can connect from afar while Remote Access is on." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "远程访问打开时，你在“设备”中配对的设备可以从远处连接。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The hardware encoder is busy or not answering, so streams use the software encoder: up to 60 fps at Standard resolution. Sill switches back by itself once it keeps up again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "硬件编码器繁忙或无响应，因此串流改用软件编码器：标准分辨率下最高 60 fps。硬件编码器恢复后，Sill 会自动切换回去。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The hardware encoder is stuck, so streams use the software encoder: up to 60 fps at Standard resolution. Restarting the Mac fixes this." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "硬件编码器卡住了，因此串流改用软件编码器：标准分辨率下最高 60 fps。重新启动 Mac 即可解决。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The link can’t carry %@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "当前链路带不动“%@”"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The login item and the permissions follow this copy of Sill. Keep one copy, in Applications." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "登录项和权限都跟随这一份 Sill。请只保留一份，并放在“应用程序”文件夹中。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The macOS firewall blocks %@, so devices on the network cannot connect. In Terminal:" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS 防火墙阻止了%@，因此网络中的设备无法连接。请在“终端”中运行："
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The macOS firewall blocks %@." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS 防火墙阻止了%@。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The macOS firewall blocks all incoming connections, so devices on the network cannot connect. %@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS 防火墙阻止了所有传入连接，因此网络中的设备无法连接。%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The macOS firewall blocks all incoming connections." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS 防火墙阻止了所有传入连接。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The streamed window is on the virtual display" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "所串流的窗口在虚拟显示器上"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Then press ⌘V there." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "然后在那里按 ⌘V。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This Mac can’t be reached while it’s asleep. While a device is connected from away, Sill keeps it from going to sleep by itself." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这台 Mac 睡眠时无法访问。有设备从远程连接时，Sill 会阻止它自动睡眠。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This build of Sill has no version number, so it can’t check." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此版本的 Sill 没有版本号，因此无法检查。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This code expired." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此配对码已过期。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This code no longer works." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此配对码已失效。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This copy of Sill can’t keep this setting: only Sill’s releases from GitHub can." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这份 Sill 无法保存此设置：只有来自 GitHub 的 Sill 正式版才可以。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This copy of Sill isn’t a notarized release, so it can’t update itself." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这份 Sill 不是经过公证的正式版，因此无法自行更新。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This folder holds the copy of Sill that an update replaced and could not put back.\nTo go back to it, quit Sill and move the app in this folder to your Applications folder.\n" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此文件夹中是一份被更新替换、且未能放回原位的 Sill。\n如需改回使用它，请退出 Sill，并将此文件夹中的 App 移到“应用程序”文件夹中。\n"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This is the Mac’s name." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这是这台 Mac 的名称。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This network. Use it with a VPN into your home network, such as WireGuard on your router." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此网络。配合连回家庭网络的 VPN 使用，例如路由器上的 WireGuard。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This run checks a test feed, so it doesn’t update itself." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "本次运行检查的是测试源，因此不会自行更新。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "To unlock it from here, type its password and press Return. Its windows come back once it is unlocked." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "要从这里解锁，请输入它的密码并按 Return。解锁后它的窗口就会回来。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Too long to send: %@ takes up to %@ of text." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Too long to send: %1$@ takes up to %2$@ of text."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "太长了，无法发送：%1$@ 最多接收 %2$@ 的文本。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Try Again" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "重试"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn On Remote Access" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "打开远程访问"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn off Block all incoming connections in System Settings › Network › Firewall › Options." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "请在“系统设置 › 网络 › 防火墙 › 选项”中关闭“阻止所有传入连接”。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn this on to pair while you use this Mac through Screen Sharing or another remote desktop app, as you would a Mac without a display. While it’s on, anyone who can see this Mac’s screen remotely can read the code. Devices streaming this Mac never show the window." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "如果你通过屏幕共享或其他远程桌面 App 使用这台 Mac（比如没有接显示器的 Mac），打开此项即可配对。打开期间，任何能远程看到这台 Mac 屏幕的人都能读到配对码。正在串流这台 Mac 的设备永远不会显示该窗口。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ultra" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "超高"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Unavailable: %@" : {
